  "excerpt": "A practical office carpet-cleaning schedule for low-, medium- and high-traffic workplaces, including winter conditions in the Greater Toronto Area.",
  "seoDescription": "A practical office carpet-cleaning schedule for low-, medium- and high-traffic workplaces, including winter conditions in the Greater Toronto Area.",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-13T12:00:00Z",
  "author": {
    "_type": "reference",
    "_ref": "author-softnest"
  },
  "categories": [
    {
