  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-0-span",
          "text": "Most offices benefit from professional carpet cleaning every 6 to 12 months, but that range is only a starting point. A quiet private office and a busy reception area do not collect soil at the same rate. Entrances, hallways, shared kitchens and desk-chair zones often need attention sooner than low-traffic rooms.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-1-span",
          "text": "The most useful plan is based on actual traffic, weather exposure and appearance—not a single date applied to the entire workplace.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-2",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-2-span",
          "text": "A Practical Cleaning Schedule",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-3-span",
          "text": "Every 3–6 months: busy entrances, public-facing offices, medical or service environments, and workplaces with heavy foot traffic.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-4-span",
          "text": "Every 6–12 months: typical offices with steady daily use and effective vacuuming and entrance-mat programs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-5-span",
          "text": "As needed between full cleanings: visible spots, salt marks, spills and heavily used paths before they spread or become difficult to remove.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-6-span",
          "text": "These intervals are planning guides rather than guarantees. Carpet fibre, colour, installation, occupancy and building rules can all change the appropriate schedule.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-7",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-7-span",
          "text": "Why GTA Winters Often Shorten the Interval",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-8-span",
          "text": "Snow, slush, road salt and fine grit are tracked through entrances during Ontario winters. Moisture helps soil stick to fibres, while repeated foot traffic pushes particles deeper into the pile. Pale salt marks may remain even after dry vacuuming.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-9-span",
          "text": "Good entrance matting and frequent vacuuming reduce the load, but they do not eliminate it. Scheduling an interim entrance and traffic-lane cleaning during winter can be more efficient than waiting for the entire office to look dull.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-10",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-10-span",
          "text": "Signs the Carpet Needs Cleaning Earlier",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-11",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-11-span",
          "text": "traffic lanes remain grey after vacuuming;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-12",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-12-span",
          "text": "spots reappear or collect soil quickly;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-13",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-13-span",
          "text": "salt or moisture marks are visible near entrances;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-14",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-14-span",
          "text": "the carpet feels sticky or matted;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-15",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-15-span",
          "text": "odours remain in enclosed areas;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-16",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-16-span",
          "text": "an important client visit, inspection or tenant turnover is approaching.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-17",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-17-span",
          "text": "Daily and Weekly Maintenance Still Matter",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-18",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_type": "link",
          "_key": "text-18-link",
          "href": "/blog/does-vacuuming-clean-carpet/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-18-span-0",
          "text": "Professional cleaning works best as part of a maintenance program. Vacuum high-traffic areas frequently, keep equipment filters and bags in good condition, use adequate entrance matting, and respond to spills promptly. A vacuum handles loose dry soil; deeper cleaning addresses residue and embedded contamination that ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-18-span-1",
          "text": "vacuuming leaves behind",
          "marks": [
            "text-18-link"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-18-span-2",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-19",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-19-span",
          "text": "Record recurring spots and the dates of previous cleanings. That history makes it easier to adjust the schedule and identify areas where a protective mat, furniture layout change or more frequent maintenance would help.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-20",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-20-span",
          "text": "Clean the Whole Office or Only High-Traffic Areas?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-21",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-21-span",
          "text": "A full cleaning creates the most consistent appearance, but interim maintenance can target entrances, hallways and other busy zones. The right choice depends on how uneven the soil is, how long it has been since the last complete service and whether furniture must be moved.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-22",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-22-span",
          "text": "For occupied offices, the cleaning plan should also consider access, noise, drying time and when employees can safely return to each area. After-hours or staged cleaning may reduce disruption.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-23",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-23-span",
          "text": "What to Include When Requesting an Estimate",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-24",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-24-span",
          "text": "approximate carpeted square footage;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-25",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-25-span",
          "text": "photos of entrances, traffic lanes and major spots;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-26",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-26-span",
          "text": "the number of stairs, offices and open work areas;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-27",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-27-span",
          "text": "parking, elevator and after-hours access details;",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-28",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-28-span",
          "text": "the preferred service window and any building requirements.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-29",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-29-span",
          "text": "Office Carpet Cleaning Across the GTA",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-30",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-30-span",
          "text": "SoftNest Fabric Care provides commercial carpet cleaning in Mississauga and surrounding Greater Toronto Area communities. We can help assess traffic patterns and build a practical plan for a one-time refresh or recurring maintenance.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-31",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-31-span",
          "text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-32",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-32-span",
          "text": "Is annual carpet cleaning enough for an office?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-33",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-33-span",
          "text": "It may be enough for a lower-traffic workplace with strong routine maintenance. Busy entrances and public areas often need cleaning more frequently.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-34",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-34-span",
          "text": "How long should office carpet dry?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-35",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-35-span",
          "text": "Drying time varies with the carpet, method, soil level, ventilation, temperature and humidity. Your cleaner should explain the expected conditions and when the area can return to normal use.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-36",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-36-span",
          "text": "Can only the entrance and hallways be cleaned?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "text-37",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "text-37-span",
          "text": "Yes, targeted interim cleaning can maintain high-traffic areas between full services, provided the result will remain visually consistent with nearby carpet.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "order": 6,
  "showCover": false
}
